tatus","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§12.4 and §13.1, pp. 300–302, 320–324; local asymptotic class notation"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DTIME}\">\\(\\mathsf{DTIME}\\)</span> (deterministic time classes, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8658210215541698\" href=\"?note=8658210215541698\" title=\"73-df-multitape-time-bounds\">73-df-multitape-time-bounds</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}class\\text{-}p}\\vdash\n\\mathsf P\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}\\mathsf{DTIME}(n\\mapsto(n+1)^k)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}class\\text{-}p}\\vdash\n\\mathsf P\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}\\mathsf{DTIME}(n\\mapsto(n+1)^k)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>All languages are over the fixed binary alphabet; changing among standard deterministic multitape models changes time by at most a polynomial and therefore does not change <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P\">\\(\\mathsf P\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The shift by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> makes every displayed resource bound positive at input length <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> without changing the asymptotic class.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-multitape-time-bounds","status":"resolved","id":"8658210215541698","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-multitape-time-bounds","status":"resolved","id":"8658210215541698","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{DTIME}$ (deterministic time classes, see [[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{DTIME}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}class\\text{-}p}\\vdash\n\\mathsf P\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}}\\mathsf{DTIME}(n\\mapsto(n+1)^k)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf P","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false}],"bytes":1531,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-246","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-p|Complexity Class P]]"},{"id":"f083376270d496d8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"25929fba481aa4a1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8527287e791b6212","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6d2cda23f5f4d367","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d2364757335c3ba6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{LOGSPACE},\\mathsf{NL}$ 见 [[73-df-logarithmic-space-classes]]，$\\mathsf P$ 见 [[73-df-binary-p]]。输入读头必须遵守其工作空间模型的有界约定。"},{"id":"9a591370db4d4b2b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $A\\in\\mathsf{NPC}$，相关类与归约见 [[73-df-binary-p]]、[[73-df-b